window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Stealing a prized jewel is nothing compared to a heart.</b></p> <p>Raised to be the perfect thief, Lyra is not above using her body or her siren's song to take exactly what she wants, when she wants it.</p> <p>But when she is attacked and her song is stolen, there’s only one fae that can help her. The fae she’d sworn to stay far away from. Now, she must find a way to win over the commander of the Flame Court, even if it means sacrificing everything she’s ever learned about being a siren.</p> <p>She thinks she can fool him, fool them all. But really, she is only fooling herself.</p> <p><b><i>This standalone spin-off will stow you away on pirate ships, lure you under the sea, and wrench the beating heart from your chest with this star-crossed lovers’ tale.</i></b></p>"; 
